        "en": "Pet owners consistently praise the veterinary surgeons and support staff for their welcoming manner, thorough consultations, and clear explanations. Reviewers frequently mention Dr. Maggie and the nursing team by name, appreciating their patient communication and genuine empathy during examinations and complex medical treatments."
