      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently emphasize how gently and affectionately the clinicians handle both dogs and cats. Many reviewers note that even anxious, rescue, or senior pets remain calm and relaxed during clinical examinations, nail trims, and surgical procedures thanks to the team's attentive and reassuring approach."
      },
      "mentions": 30,
      "sentiment": "positive"
    },
