        "en": "Pet owners report dependable clinical outcomes for complex conditions, including respiratory illnesses, chronic endocrine disorders, and surgical procedures. Reviewers appreciate that the veterinarians offer practical treatment options and accurate diagnoses, helping family pets recover quickly and comfortably."
      },
      "mentions": 5,
      "sentiment": "positive"
    }
